# A copy of Twinned Vision was never cast, so it is not "cast from your hand" and draws two cards instead of one (CR 707.10,
# 601.2a). Bot1 casts Vision from the hand (Mox Ruby + Mox Sapphire), and with it on the stack flashes in Lutri (Black Lotus,
# blue x3), whose enters trigger copies it. The copy resolves first (draws two), then the original (cast from the hand, draws one).
# Hand: 7 - 5 cast = 2; the copy resolves first (2 drawn, hand 4, the original alone on the stack), then the original (1 drawn, hand 5).

